 "note": "R242. The third domain's ask vocabulary, measured and mostly refused. The six cue-less families (suspend, resume, roaming, refuel, plan, credit) are added one at a time to the shipped, guarded goal_board table and read through goal_board.census on the domain's own 20 tasks and on the retail and airline goals. Four reach no required write; refuel buys one write for thirteen spurious asks (the token appears in the concession 'willing to refuel if necessary', not in a request); credit adds ten spurious retail asks ('credit card'). None is admissible, so no cue ships. The one repair that does ship is a negative lookahead on the return cue: 'the speed test returns excellent' and 'the tool call does not return updated status' were read as refund asks 40 times on the telecom sample, all spurious; the guard clears all 40 and moves neither retail's 176 nor airline's 15.",
